🇮🇷🇺🇸| Iran published images of an intercepted American BGM-109 Tomahawk cruise missile launched from a US destroyer in the Gulf of Oman toward Iran.

The missile was shot down by the Iranian air defenses in Khorramabad, Lorestan province, yesterday. 

